              </div>
              <div class="kpi-cell">
                <span class="kpi-cell__label">Service Bays Active</span>
                <strong class="kpi-cell__val">14 / 16</strong>
                <span class="kpi-cell__sub highlight">88% Capacity Utilization</span>
              </div>
              <div class="kpi-cell">
