                </div>
                <span class="status-pill status-ready">Delivery Ready</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feed-row">
                <div class="feed-icon blue">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0b55d9" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="feed-details">
                  <strong>Job Card #JC-4921 &bull; Bay 04 (Brake Overhaul)</strong>
                  <span>Parts Dispatched: Front Brake Disc Kit (OEM-4402)</span>
                </div>
                <span class="status-pill status-service">In Service</span>
              </div>

              <div class="feed-row">
                <div class="feed-icon purple">
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
                </div>
                <div class="feed-details">
                  <strong>EV Sedan E-600 &bull; Battery Diagnostics Passed</strong>
                  <span>State of Charge: 98% &bull; Test Drive Scheduled @ 3:30 PM</span>
                </div>
                <span class="status-pill status-test">Test Drive</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Workflow Pointers -->
            <div class="console-footer-flow">
              <div class="flow-step done">1. Lead</div>
              <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>
              <div class="flow-step done">2. VIN</div>
              <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>
              <div class="flow-step done">3. Delivery</div>
              <span class="flow-arrow">→</span>
              <div class="flow-step active">4. Service</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         INTERACTIVE OPERATIONAL HUB (Client-Side Tab Switcher)
    ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <section class="section soft-section" id="interactive-preview">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Interactive Operations Preview</p>
          <h2>Explore How Hegrix Powers Every Corner of Your Auto Business</h2>
          <p class="section-lead">
            Click through the operational workspaces below to see how showroom consultants, service advisors, parts managers, and dealership owners run their day.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="interactive-hub">
          <!-- Workspace Navigation Tabs with Simple SVGs -->
          <div class="hub-tabs" role="tablist">
            <button class="hub-tab active" data-target="tab-showroom" role="tab" aria-selected="true">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
              <span>1. Showroom &amp; CRM</span>
            </button>
            <button class="hub-tab" data-target="tab-inventory" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="1" y="3" width="15" height="13"/><polygon points="16 8 20 8 23 11 23 16 16 16 16 8"/><circle cx="5.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/><circle cx="18.5" cy="18.5" r="2.5"/></svg>
              <span>2. Vehicle Inventory</span>
            </button>
            <button class="hub-tab" data-target="tab-workshop" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
              <span>3. Service Bays</span>
            </button>
            <button class="hub-tab" data-target="tab-parts" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="16.5" y1="9.4" x2="7.5" y2="4.21"/><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z"/><polyline points="3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96"/><line x1="12" y1="22.08" x2="12" y2="12"/></svg>
              <span>4. Spare Parts WMS</span>
            </button>
            <button class="hub-tab" data-target="tab-executive" role="tab" aria-selected="false">
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"/><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"/><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"/></svg>
              <span>5. Multi-Branch BI</span>
            </button>
          </div>

          <!-- Tab Panels Container -->
          <div class="hub-panels">
            <!-- Tab 1: Showroom & CRM -->
            <div class="hub-panel active" id="tab-showroom">
              <div class="panel-split">
                <div class="panel-info">
                  <span class="panel-badge">Showroom Operating Workspace</span>
                  <h3>Omnichannel Lead Ingestion &amp; Test Drive Management</h3>
                  <p>Never lose a walk-in or digital lead. Hegrix automates inquiry distribution to sales consultants, verifies demo car availability, scans digital driver's licenses, and collects post-test drive feedback via automated WhatsApp flows.</p>
