                    <li><strong>Instant Lead Routing:</strong> Distribute leads from website, Google Ads, Meta, and OEM feeds within 60 seconds.</li>
                    <li><strong>Digital Test Drive KYC:</strong> Scan driver's license with OCR and capture digital indemnity signatures on tablet.</li>
                    <li><strong>Quotation &amp; Trade-In Appraisal:</strong> Generate proforma invoices with taxes, insurance, accessories, and used car valuations.</li>
                  </ul>
                  <a href="/contact-us/" class="panel-cta-btn">Test Drive the CRM Workflow →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="panel-mockup">
                  <div class="mockup-card">
                    <div class="mockup-top">
                      <strong>Showroom Lead Pipeline</strong>
                      <span class="mockup-pill green">14 Inquiries Today</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="lead-pipeline-preview">
                      <div class="pipeline-column">
                        <span class="pipe-head">New Inquiries (6)</span>
