                      </div>
                      <div class="pipeline-column">
                        <span class="pipe-head">Booking (4)</span>
                        <div class="pipe-item">
                          <strong>Anita Desai</strong>
                          <span>VIN #9284 &bull; Finance Ready</span>
                          <span class="pipe-badge blue">Deposit Paid</span>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tab 2: Vehicle Inventory & VIN -->
            <div class="hub-panel" id="tab-inventory">
              <div class="panel-split">
                <div class="panel-info">
                  <span class="panel-badge">Stock &amp; Allocation Hub</span>
                  <h3>17-Digit VIN Specification Engine &amp; Yard Tracking</h3>
                  <p>Gain absolute clarity over vehicle stock across multiple showroom floors, holding yards, and in-transit trailers. Prevent double bookings and monitor aging inventory with automated markdown alerts.</p>
                  <ul class="panel-checklist">
                    <li><strong>Automated VIN Decoder:</strong> Instant parsing of manufacturer, engine displacement, transmission, and color variants.</li>
                    <li><strong>Customer Reservation Locker:</strong> Lock specific VINs to client bookings with token payment validation.</li>
                    <li><strong>Days-in-Stock Analytics:</strong> Automated alerts when a vehicle approaches 60+ days in yard storage.</li>
