            <!-- Tab 3: Service Bays & Job Cards -->
            <div class="hub-panel" id="tab-workshop">
              <div class="panel-split">
                <div class="panel-info">
                  <span class="panel-badge">After-Sales &amp; Service Bay</span>
                  <h3>360° Digital Job Cards &amp; Technician Scheduling</h3>
                  <p>Turn your workshop into a high-efficiency revenue engine. Service advisors conduct digital vehicle walkarounds with photo dent capture, assign bays, dispatch spare parts, and obtain instant WhatsApp customer approvals.</p>
