                    <li><strong>WhatsApp Estimate Approvals:</strong> Customers receive an interactive link to review and approve repair line items in 1 click.</li>
                    <li><strong>Technician Labor Hour Tracking:</strong> Log active repair hours against standard labor times for accurate billing.</li>
                  </ul>
                  <a href="/contact-us/" class="panel-cta-btn">Explore Workshop Job Cards →</a>
                </div>
                <div class="panel-mockup">
                  <div class="mockup-card">
                    <div class="mockup-top">
                      <strong>Workshop Bay Command Matrix</strong>
                      <span class="mockup-pill green">14 Active Bays</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bay-grid-preview">
                      <div class="bay-cell busy">
                        <div class="bay-top"><strong>Bay 01</strong><span>Active</span></div>
                        <p>Brake Overhaul &bull; Tech: Suresh M.</p>
                        <div class="bay-progress"><span style="width: 75%"></span></div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bay-cell busy">
                        <div class="bay-top"><strong>Bay 02</strong><span>Active</span></div>
                        <p>Periodic 20K Service &bull; Tech: Amit K.</p>
                        <div class="bay-progress"><span style="width: 40%"></span></div>
                      </div>
                      <div class="bay-cell free">
                        <div class="bay-top"><strong>Bay 03</strong><span>Ready</span></div>
                        <p>Available for Next Inspection</p>
                        <span class="bay-open-tag">+ Assign Job</span>
                      </div>
